From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: compat-bot <compat-bot@localhost>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Port landed Minecraft sources to the 1.21.9 API
Rewrites the 1.21.8-era Leaves insertions inside the decompiled tree to the
1.21.9 signatures without changing behaviour: Entity.getServer() -> static
MinecraftServer.getServer(), isClientSide field -> isClientSide() accessor,
Level.neighborUpdater widened to the NeighborUpdater interface behind an
instanceof guard in ServerLevel, supressTrackerForLogin -> the renamed
suppressTrackerForLogin, dropped the private loadGameTypes(null) call,
LevelData.getSpawnPos() -> getRespawnData().pos(), startRiding(vehicle,
force, sendGameEvent), CustomData/ExperienceOrb/CraftEventFactory argument
changes, SimpleBitStorage.compact uses PaletteResize.noResizeExpected(),
PlayerDataStorage no longer implements IPlayerDataStorage (only BotDataStorage
implements it), Mob cache fields moved out of isSunBurnTick(), missing
imports restored, servux spawn flag moved before the return so it is not
unreachable, and LivingEntity.getSlotForHand(hand) -> hand.asEquipmentSlot().

Kept as one tail patch so the 141 upstream feature patches stay byte-identical.


